WEBVTT

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:03.382
and our work has been recognized
by the US government,

00:05:03.382 --> 00:05:05.176
the International Youth Foundation

00:05:05.176 --> 00:05:06.302
and Facebook,

00:05:06.302 --> 00:05:09.680
leading us to be the first
Mexican chocolate company

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:12.808
to be awarded internationally
for social impact.

00:05:13.225 --> 00:05:16.729
Working with a community
for a community has taught me

00:05:16.729 --> 00:05:20.024
that we can simultaneously
preserve traditions,

00:05:20.024 --> 00:05:21.984
economically boost the region,

00:05:21.984 --> 00:05:23.861
employ people locally

00:05:23.861 --> 00:05:26.155
and sell a delicious product

00:05:26.155 --> 00:05:29.825
with a history that people 
care about on a global scale.